Generated Triggers: • UN Security Council convening
• Military timetable pressure increasing
Selected Actor: Soviet Union
• Selected Action: Accelerate Deployment While Denying
• Predicted Variable Change: • tension: +0.45 (covert_detection effect per Soviet effect_rules) • diplomatic_room: x0.6 (proportional reduction per covert_detection) • leadership_unity: +0.65 (covert_detection effect) • public_opinion: No direct effect
Generated Triggers: • Continued U.S. surveillance detecting acceleration
• "Incomplete deployment" constraint activated
RECONFIRM VARIABLE STATUS - Combination 3
• tension: 0.90 (0.5 - 0.05 + 0.45) • diplomatic_support: 0.36 (0.5 + 0.10, then x0.6 for diplomatic_room 
reduction) • military_posture: Asymmetric (US diplomatic, Soviet military) • public_opinion: 0.55 (0.5 + 0.05) • leadership_unity: US: 0.55, Soviet: 1.0 (capped)
Critical Alert: Tension at 0.90 exceeds 0.8 threshold - "Diplomatic Negotiation 
Disabled, Military Options Preferred" activated. Diplomatic_support below 0.5 
triggers "Diplomatic Solution Blocked" condition.
Retry
